# What epm.exe is built with: epm's runtime dependencies (pyproject.toml) without pyarrow,
# which only stores the value cache and would double the program's size, plus PyInstaller,
# and hatchling to install epm itself (pip install --no-deps --no-build-isolation .) for the
# checks that compare the program with its source.
